{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "7f8c300044a0f4c1ca5d18054b1f8423395966e18232ef9e899807b8af48fd2c", "ja": "『BIRTH』の誕生！", "zh": "『BIRTH』诞生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a2c3d9c84c0131ed7de31417c85672bd4cdebcce191bcb42695bf84169907680", "ja": "新しいユニットがダンスバリバリになりそう\nだと期待を高める歩。\n方向性は後日決めることになるが、あずさは\nついていけるか不安になる。そんなあずさに\nプロデューサーは秘密の特訓を提案する。", "zh": "步认为『BIRTH』会是个舞力全开的新团体，\n因而怀抱着相当高的期许。\n虽然团体路线还要留待日后决定，\n梓却已在担心自己是否能跟得上大家，\n于是制作人向她提议进行秘密特训。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6ea787bc81cec16b7621627ac6d34d4277377ef957f7d6f130ad0de21c7343a9", "ja": "みんな、おはよう！\n可奈と歩は……まだ来ていないみたいだな。", "zh": "大家早安！\n可奈跟步……好像还没来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "cc8132be72ca00c6ab8891734766a2fb0823e1e67be5c7f80e9f46da236755a1", "ja": "うふふ、そうみたいですね。私達、ちょっぴり\n早く来すぎてしまったのかもしれません。", "zh": "唔呵呵，看来是呢。\n我们可能有点来太早了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "627c23fd7f973a3560232dbec4dc647e99fc6e2607c35e6abe8053f8e2dac6fa", "ja": "{$P$}。私と真ちゃんとあずささんの\n他に、可奈ちゃんと歩ちゃんも呼んだんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}，除了我、小真跟阿梓姊，\n你还有找可奈跟小步来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f038ef0679707d339ec535854ffef8696dc53c0c09257d9af1cf2f19ef2e7ea8", "ja": "うん。それがどうかしたのか？", "zh": "嗯，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "fc30e9351403b2d624a919d994a3055da860438ae4b9876c18d5a4b2b552b282", "ja": "も、もしかして……。\n私達にも、とうとうアレが……？", "zh": "难、难道……\n我们终于也要那个了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "9aa268ef85ad0ebfdf2c1426223534822f49c7c691c0c866fcf3b4b8108a9506", "ja": "え？　雪歩、アレって？", "zh": "咦？雪步，那个是指什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "82422ce0332b4782fcce9d9f7df970fd0711920cd62f8c5a7aa428242348418c", "ja": "ひょっとして、アレのことなんじゃないかしら。\n劇場のお掃除当番……。", "zh": "该不会是指那个吧？\n轮值打扫剧场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "685ff0ef08b0e707ec25c8aeec698a0d1eb2b38c7847c04d6b538831902ec79d", "ja": "ああ！　それは、誰かがやらなきゃいけないですよね。\nボク、ちゃんとやりますよ、{$P$}！", "zh": "哦！确实要有人负责打扫才行呢。\n在下一定会打扫干净喔，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "bad5dc0066b6d6f9a80994393c57a373da2bd057e6c8e9f9c862f8cd77e354b0", "ja": "いや、掃除当番じゃなくて……今度、5人に\n新しいユニットを組んでもらうことになったんだ。", "zh": "没有啦，不是轮值打扫……\n这次是要请你们五人组成新团体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "e8a2b44d98caf28dacb2ce029068a74137c25515d5e097b36c858ec7548fc225", "ja": "ゆ、ユニット！？　ボクたちが、ですか！？", "zh": "团、团体！？由我们来组团吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c47484eb9770cd1d95975d456909c6c19291b4681b8399432a54442d5b251a7d", "ja": "はうぅ！　や、やっぱり……！", "zh": "啊呜！果、果然……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "1330b3a6aea8c225567cecab369bcdf2cabe44230ab3e98e928ac9ac17e42710", "ja": "劇場のユニットって、とっても評判がいいんですよね？\nお客さんにも、大好評って聞きましたけど。", "zh": "记得剧场推出的团体全都大受好评吧？\n我听说在观众之间也佳评如潮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9aced031f06276d5de54f840c35725af1b58fb5514c4b20c26d0fa90d02c1070", "ja": "はい……その新しいユニットに、\n今度は私たちが選ばれたってことですよね？", "zh": "没错……也就是说，\n这次换我们被选为新团体的成员啰？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d1be4a4afcee49527bcd27eea7bfa5618f9ee055e1e7ee90f4e6fcb2469adc9b", "ja": "そういうことだ。3人にはアイドルの先輩として、\n他の2人を引っ張っていってほしい。", "zh": "就是这样没错。\n希望你们三位偶像前辈能带领另外两人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1014_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a0e67815669e6daaaf8f7c26f1397906827907e94b79881a0d5e234ac406c427", "ja": "せ、先輩として……！\nうう、私にできるかな……？", "zh": "前、前辈……！\n呜呜，我做得到吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "ce14295d0040baf32340426cfa7d7da7641d300706445c4456063b8ca65a21bb", "ja": "うふふ、大丈夫よ、雪歩ちゃん。\nいつもどおりに頑張れば、きっといい結果になるわ。", "zh": "唔呵呵，没问题的，雪步。\n只要像平常一样努力，一定会有好结果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0743fa49fd4c8ecd0141eb7569e70d438743e0f981a4de61a816d0aec0cdaa59", "ja": "あずささん……そ、そうですよね。\nいつもどおりに頑張れば、きっと……。", "zh": "阿梓姊……说、说得也是，\n只要像平常一样努力，一定……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "a84a6f4831b0c23a9947223f0a9737b60308aa163573c29e0fc5aa12b47ec7f0", "ja": "ボクたちが、先輩としてかぁ……。\nへへっ、なんか照れますね！", "zh": "我们是前辈啊……\n嘿嘿，感觉好害羞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "f712bd64ebaf8dd9c698051cb0f67d2b81eaabd6035c62a281fe0cbb4a12ce81", "ja": "わかりました！　ボクたち3人で、歩と可奈を\nガンガン引っ張っていきます。まかせてください！", "zh": "在下明白了！\n我们三个会积极带领步跟可奈，请交给我们吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f5089cc0cfd521b420802d31ce0273e7cbc664792bd269b0985ddaa09cd78189", "ja": "よし。みんな、頼んだぞ！", "zh": "好，就交给你们啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1021_010azu", "source_sha256": "9bee1fe06cb5231d6fb5fa2ee7d4af79926b7a1bf612297e254e51acd62885ae", "ja": "はい♪", "zh": "好的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1022_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f8a9b3427a0d22e994d4cb3f988919d822adcd6df39a13e3ea83974d6debe5b4", "ja": "はいぃっ！", "zh": "好的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2c795a19ed880f95d0b6fc90fe47f044963bd4655b7bb2faf1af2c0a80ffd6ba", "ja": "{$P$}、遅れてゴメン！\n出掛けに靴紐が切れちゃってさ……。", "zh": "{$P$}，抱歉我迟到了！\n我要出门时鞋带正好断了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "9b7858279d741e2e871fbfc6a5f434e20efb8e7f6d6795255d2c01aff3944782", "ja": "おはようございます～！\n途中で歩さんと会ったので、一緒に来ちゃいました！", "zh": "早安～！\n我在路上遇到步姊，所以跟她一起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "6797b90717cc48c9c62b73fc2efae5306f845df2822b85133c65721c0ff69ec1", "ja": "歩、可奈、おはよう。\n……歩、なんだか疲れてるみたいだな？", "zh": "步、可奈，早安。\n……步，你好像很累的样子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1026_034ayu", "source_sha256": "dd02e9239ab4dc143638123405de5a9037e58b870f86490244bfcc83f72b45be", "ja": "そうなんだよ～！　乗ろうとした電車が目の前で\n行っちゃうし、駅前歩いてたら水まきの水を被るし！", "zh": "就是说啊～！先是想搭的电车在眼前跑掉，\n然后走在车站前面又被洒水器的水喷到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1027_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c10e6cf7d42587441233adad0b88e38136067f58a5173d3f63339e1a0eeccc5a", "ja": "ま、あったかかったから、いいんだけどさ！\nそういや可奈も水被ってたけど、大丈夫だった？", "zh": "不过天气很暖和，所以是没差啦！\n话说可奈也被水喷到了，你没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1028_036kan", "source_sha256": "4561d49ba663172a42bdc78d2d06d1395a691e27d91905ed1ceb328bffb495de", "ja": "はい、ちょびっと濡れただけです！\n太陽サンサン～♪　可奈と歩さんはさんざん～♪", "zh": "没事，我只有被喷到一点点！\n阳光灿灿～♪可奈跟步姊惨惨～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1029_010azu", "source_sha256": "c4e796c47b89c79ed99351918cb05e2ec01f0b0fe264328bea86358298026bc8", "ja": "まあ、ふたりとも大変だったのね……。風邪を\n引かないように、ちゃんと拭いておきましょうね。", "zh": "哎呀，真是苦了你们两个呢……\n要好好擦干身体，小心不要感冒啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "6649801cf6cb2981c85f994af75e51db33c3138ad15dcab2f78b2e3360472b10", "ja": "あっ、あずささん、ありがとうございます。\n優しいな～、えへへ……♪", "zh": "啊，阿梓姊，谢谢你。\n你好温柔喔～嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1031_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0ca15976826dae928ac2a63692b6474d6de1d77e478de1bea9ddd22f3aa15b24", "ja": "それで、{$P$}。\nアタシたちに話って、なに？", "zh": "所以说，{$P$}，\n你要跟我们说的事情是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1032_p", "source_sha256": "3e6f4eb0716935949e1588afd2b65265e9077cbc9f565120efd34bb19cb84e2a", "ja": "ああ。この3人には、もう話したんだけど……\n今度この5人で、ユニットを組むことになったんだ。", "zh": "这个啊，我刚才已经跟先另外三位说了……\n这次要请你们五个人组成团体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1033_034ayu", "source_sha256": "444c49f37c59a4d9a47d76d6f2be09444446a326700411a2c6d95aa3b365b189", "ja": "え！？　ここにいる5人でユニットって……マジ！？", "zh": "咦！？由在场这五个人组成团体……真的假的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1034_036kan", "source_sha256": "8cb8b79674ba2286b0efccf45cdc154a1c02e15a54ade5ce1df96a8e5c32ca97", "ja": "わ、私もですか！？", "zh": "我、我也是吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1035_p", "source_sha256": "a1fb42d3e6ed5d8677965e2c449fc84039152a39cc211dd75a6b3ea22a83a137", "ja": "ああ。メンバーは真、雪歩、あずささん、歩、可奈。\nユニットの名前は『BIRTH』、リーダーは真だ！", "zh": "没错，成员有真、雪步、梓小姐、步、可奈。\n团体名称是『BIRTH』，队长是真！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1036_006mak", "source_sha256": "832f2cfd70c359e6e7f84a40a5bc25d70e146803fd523e0da094eb576951b94a", "ja": "BIRTHかぁ。カッコイイな～！\n……ん？　ええっ、ボクがリーダー！？", "zh": "『BIRTH』啊，真帅气～！\n……嗯？什么，在下是队长！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1037_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2d74ebabf582450aa27257d20fffa2118c23ea0fc029884cfb8feb95b7775252", "ja": "わぁ……♪　おめでとう、真ちゃん！", "zh": "哇……♪恭喜你，小真！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1038_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e505a9b90b0ec27dc008d485e4a4def5fee35bd0a52eead9b4d4921f7ced1c98", "ja": "真がリーダーのユニットか……！\nなんだか、スゴいユニットになりそうだな！", "zh": "由真来当队长吗……！\n感觉会是非常厉害的团体！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1039_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c9f46e1babbefd4099fc1759241b199cd963990aa3a9aa89b561ef7257e3bcaa", "ja": "やっぱ、ダンスバリバリのかっこいいユニットかな？\nう～ん、楽しみになってきたーっ！", "zh": "我想八成会是舞力全开的帅气团体吧？\n嗯～我开始期待了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1040_p", "source_sha256": "563d33989b153f8d105b01a3732e017e2a3d2834e1547c3e95e132fbdb02bcbf", "ja": "ユニットの方向性は、また後で話し合うとして……\n早速、明日からレッスン開始だ。みんな、よろしくな！", "zh": "团体路线等以后再讨论……\n明天要立刻展开训练课程，拜托大家了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1041_006mak", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1042_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4cdf426c11016bcf36aa3d52bedda8105a2b628163da1e38d75650958d536a82", "ja": "はいっ。", "zh": "好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1043_010azu", "source_sha256": "259b1273383b0bdb6edb79df720a6038b50ad1640d625fdd6249182573293172", "ja": "はい～。", "zh": "好的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1044_036kan", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1045_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1046_p", "source_sha256": "0ddf71c9395ec092d572e75a2e19956bf131ac3ecbae3c663c3e7782d3707b1b", "ja": "（BIRTHのメンバーは仲良くやっていけそうだな。\nあとは年下の可奈を、うまくフォローしないと……）", "zh": "（『BIRTH』的成员似乎能处得很好。\n再来就是得好好协助年纪较小的可奈……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1047_010azu", "source_sha256": "e9a66ce930cbd000157b617ba466aa4212299cf613f2458fa8e7ca83911c9a01", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん。\nちょっといいですか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生，\n可以打扰一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1048_p", "source_sha256": "3630c15a04ff96658230b0966c26508b12f587db9d93a212a6d033191116e2d6", "ja": "あ、あずささん。\nどうかしたんですか？", "zh": "啊，梓小姐。\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1049_010azu", "source_sha256": "dc19dc1d7afef5107136a405508a761c5e49275f1fe9c4b2014336d5822eb41f", "ja": "実は、ユニットのことで……雪歩ちゃんじゃ\nありませんけど、私も少し不安があって。", "zh": "其实是关于团体的事……\n虽然不至于像雪步那样，但我也有点不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1050_010azu", "source_sha256": "e5dbb94740e5aec4f6f7e9281c40502969f89087cdae3644c9e4e71304f82782", "ja": "私、自分で言うのもなんですけど、おっとりしてる\nほうですから。ついていけるかしら……って。", "zh": "由我自己来说也有点不好意思，但我的个性比较温吞，\n所以我担心……自己会跟不上其他人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1051_p", "source_sha256": "270eb46e19693ba9929639fc92c7a5f761c6170c67d8ae7eca9c5523e5414c43", "ja": "そんな、大丈夫ですよ。レッスンに不安があるなら、\n俺がいつでも特訓に付き合いますから。", "zh": "怎么会？不用担心。\n如果你对训练感到不安，我随时都能陪你特训。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1052_010azu", "source_sha256": "9e8798738c2572f9cddf62097cf3b73ec40030d2e189ed2d4b2383b3f8c7b5a4", "ja": "まあ、本当ですか？　それじゃさっそく、\n明日から特訓をお願いできますか？", "zh": "哎呀，真的吗？\n那么事不宜迟，可以明天就开始特训吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1053_p", "source_sha256": "09f0bafcd09bb4def23c09f576d91ad20663d83700c6bba68e97cd0328b1e9ec", "ja": "はい、もちろん！　あずささんが納得するまで、\nいくらでも付き合いますよ！", "zh": "好，当然可以！\n我会一直陪着梓小姐，直到你满意为止！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1054_010azu", "source_sha256": "4819a5eb80ab0139b7f8e186f804142b6c96277c9b439a63dfab8a5fd3ba1d13", "ja": "よかった……。ありがとうございます、\n{$P$}さん。", "zh": "太好了……谢谢你，\n{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1055_010azu", "source_sha256": "13d3e7300db2c9b76626edb08c41dfc74ca5fd483fb707441adca8c4c7f9ea57", "ja": "公演が始まるまでの間、秘密の特訓……ふふっ。\n改めて、よろしくお願いしますね♪", "zh": "到公演开始前的秘密特训……呵呵。\n再次请你多多指教啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1056_p", "source_sha256": "a895e294905264aff40752c487a30ae83f4ca4774a4fca87fe1ad39484a64514", "ja": "（あずささんも不安だったんだな。でも、自分なりに\n前向きに努力しようとしているところは、流石だ）", "zh": "（原来梓小姐也会不安。\n但她会以自己的方式积极努力，这点真令人佩服。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1057_p", "source_sha256": "6c8134aa42febb7dc1f466667ea2ca5e494ba4b876713b3d14d56be61803e244", "ja": "最後に控え室の鍵を閉めて、と……。\nあれ、歩？　まだ残ってたのか？", "zh": "最后锁上准备室的门……\n咦，步？你还没走吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1058_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3225f42c3cf7554046c0cd6866dfb4489376a9bfc85e173067199ef5c62011ee", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nへへ、そうなんだ。靴がなかなか乾かなくってさ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n嘿嘿，对啊，因为鞋子一直没干。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1059_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f54399ddc446562c678e41a410966590d7cd9854aa10825003c17e411c21abfb", "ja": "そっか、もうこんな時間だったんだなー。\nゴメン、すぐ帰るよ！", "zh": "原来已经这个时间了啊～\n抱歉，我马上回去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1060_p", "source_sha256": "3a201d5ebcce5e74bc42d4a9d9833b64b1b12a3fb2a48d173f081bd3367bbbc5", "ja": "なら、一緒に行こうか。\nついでだし、駅まで送っていくよ。", "zh": "那我们一起走吧？\n反正顺路，我送你到车站。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1061_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1d029fb44ddcf92bd82e1aa4789142e343785f2771945abb0003b562a1dffb9d", "ja": "えっ、いいの？\nサンキュー、{$P$}！", "zh": "咦，可以吗？\n谢啦，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1062_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8dc79c51b070dbaa27a757816f721b36e2f3c1871711a4405b8f893293463b4a", "ja": "なぁ、{$P$}。今回のユニットって、\n誰が決めたの？　{$P$}？", "zh": "我说{$P$}，这次的团体是谁决定的？\n是{$P$}你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1063_p", "source_sha256": "ddd1f7d54455ae045cfff2bd107486ea5b89d50f67b1a73d2405684065b1c972", "ja": "いや、社長だよ。それがどうかしたのか？", "zh": "不，是社长。怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1064_034ayu", "source_sha256": "18f824974d4730e835efc6772e71d3744b3701367a1f806490bb129f6b9201cf", "ja": "ううん！　別に深い意味はないんだけど……\nそっか、社長なんだ。", "zh": "没有！没什么特别的意思……\n这样啊，原来是社长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1065_034ayu", "source_sha256": "aede86196c2b0dc14620c7c9e4d1599775804e19ef48b9688d840138546ff59e", "ja": "ほら、アタシとあずさは、一応、年が上だろ。\n真と雪歩は同じ年で、仲良しだし……。", "zh": "你想想看嘛，我跟梓算是年纪比较大，对吧？\n真跟雪步同年，而且感情很好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1066_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8c55ef46cf67cc57915eca68d5b6330cbec25d9e6cc0dc110d98acf40bf00182", "ja": "でも、可奈だけちょっと年下だからさ。\nもしかしたら大変なのかなって思って。", "zh": "但只有可奈年纪比较小，\n所以我在想她说不定会很辛苦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1067_p", "source_sha256": "4ae888c8626d5bdfe4b0d4b5e10d2d1597ceafc84774b93e61a6457b0abbd703", "ja": "そうだな、俺もそう思っていたところだ。\n歩、気遣ってくれてありがとう。", "zh": "是啊，我也正好在想这件事。\n步，谢谢你这么为她着想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1068_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1a2f7e78072f1ab35fb83c7646b7ef42cd3948bf674331c975712c54903da8b7", "ja": "べ、別に、気遣ったとかそんなんでもないけど……\n同じユニットの仲間だからさ♪", "zh": "没、没有啦，也称不上什么着想……\n我们毕竟是同一个团体的伙伴嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1069_034ayu", "source_sha256": "682029396a331914eae5a73f8b05f17ea78b22d23b719c0b5ff9dc9401c07352", "ja": "ちょっとでもいいカンジになって、\n5人で最高のステージにしたいよな！", "zh": "所以会希望大家多少能变得更好，\n然后五个人一起呈现出最精彩的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1070_p", "source_sha256": "8dc35582bd6e8a5c8a2fe4089cdcac76bff1b32d655b3693aa308ad45977ab4c", "ja": "そうだな。そしてそれには、歩の力が必要だ。\nよろしくな、歩！", "zh": "说得对，为此我们需要步的力量。\n还要拜托你啰，步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1071_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0e2619983ab216a85bce8928b87be8d74c3e5568998a8534017585b0fcd33bb6", "ja": "う、うん！　ダンスなら、アタシにまかせてよ♪\nアイアム、ナンバーワ～ンッ！", "zh": "嗯，好啊！舞蹈方面就交给我吧♪\nI'm No.1～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_01_1072_p", "source_sha256": "20df8b4d14cb29a09d87ee0d25e01dda7fdae305a24687655de55418b14bfcb5", "ja": "（歩も、いつも以上に前向きになってくれている。\nBIRTHの公演、目が離せないものになりそうだ！）", "zh": "（步也显得比平常更积极。\n『BIRTH』想必会呈现出令人目不转睛的公演！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
